{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/2cb1e835c0bdbaee7f9ddc9241671d31.poster.avif?t=1773722487\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/2cb1e835c0bdbaee7f9ddc9241671d31.webm?t=1773722487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/2cb1e835c0bdbaee7f9ddc9241671d31.mp4?t=1773722487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spirit Weaver is a visual novel game set in the beautiful and mystical realms of the spirits. A strange darkness known as The Entropy is threatening the realm, absorbing the spiritual powers of its denizens and causing many to disappear. You play as a Tarot Reader, summoned by your Spirit Guides to bring aid to the realm. Your mission is to meet and get to know the various confused spirits, help guide them by using the power of Tarot, and ultimately restore balance to the Spirit Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/8caf0a44ae83b8d85909b82f3e45a0d6.poster.avif?t=1773722487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/8caf0a44ae83b8d85909b82f3e45a0d6.webm?t=1773722487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/8caf0a44ae83b8d85909b82f3e45a0d6.mp4?t=1773722487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a bittersweet story about love, grief, and finding ways to keep moving forward. To progress, you must listen to the characters' stories and empathize with how they think and feel to find the best solutions for their problems. The core gameplay revolves around performing Tarot readings. Much like real Tarot, there are no &quot;wrong&quot; or &quot;right&quot; interpretations of the cards, just better and best ones. The quality of your readings determines the fate of the Spirit Realm and your own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/df15919116f2e42e0579660bca86836a.poster.avif?t=1773722487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/df15919116f2e42e0579660bca86836a.webm?t=1773722487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/df15919116f2e42e0579660bca86836a.mp4?t=1773722487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save this world and someone precious to you, return to Earth without closure, or become trapped in the Spirit Realm forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bittersweet Story:</strong> Immerse yourself in a narrative about people coping with loss, love, and grief, split into characters with different ideals and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guide with Tarot:</strong> As a Fortune Teller, perform Tarot readings to provide guidance and restore power to the spirits of the realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empathetic Gameplay:</strong> The key to success is understanding the characters and their feelings to find the best solutions to their problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Readings Shape the Ending:</strong> Your Tarot readings determine the end of your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Beautiful Fantasy World:</strong> Explore a fantasy setting filled with arcane and mystical elements, progressing through the four planes of the Spirit Realm.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885820?t=1773722487","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885820?t=1773722487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/8d3dc12a94d65dcd4a18f6141cf13be3edc274d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773722487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/8d3dc12a94d65dcd4a18f6141cf13be3edc274d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773722487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4234920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/2cb1e835c0bdbaee7f9ddc9241671d31.poster.avif?t=1773722487\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/2cb1e835c0bdbaee7f9ddc9241671d31.webm?t=1773722487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885820/extras/2cb1e835c0bdbaee7f9ddc9241671d31.mp4?t=1773722487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spirit Weaver is a visual novel game set in the beautiful and mystical realms of the spirits. A strange darkness known as The Entropy is threatening the realm, absorbing the spiritual powers of its denizens and causing m